      "rationale": "Identical to AhmedML and HiLiftAeroML component for component, and to DrivAerML apart from its force group, which splits three ways (cd 0.15, cl 0.05, c_pitch 0.05) because it scores pitching moment. WindsorML publishes cmy, so a c_pitch_r2 term is supported by the data, but it would need surface moment integration and a pinned moment reference point that the dataset does not publish. Not adopted."
